====================================================
c. SERVICE PACKAGE
====================================================
File: RideService.java

CONSTANT:
---------
FARE_PER_KM = 25.0  (Rs. 25 per KM)

----------------------------------------------------
TASK 1: Book a Ride
----------------------------------------------------
Method     : bookRide(Long userId, String startLocation,
                      String endLocation, double distance)
Return Type: RideDetails

Logic:
  - If no drivers are available
    --> throw exception: "No available drivers"
  - Otherwise:
    --> Calculate fare = distance * 25.0 (Rs. 25 per KM)
    --> Assign the first available driver
    --> Save and return the RideDetails

----------------------------------------------------
TASK 2: Get Recent Completed Rides
----------------------------------------------------
Method     : getRecentCompletedRides(Long userId)
Return Type: List<RideDetails>

Logic:
  - Retrieve completed rides for the user
    within the last 30 minutes
  - Return list of RideDetails matching the criteria

----------------------------------------------------
TASK 3: End a Ride
----------------------------------------------------
Method     : endRide(Long rideId)
Return Type: RideDetails

Logic:
  - End the specified ride by:
    --> Updating ride status to "Completed"
    --> Setting the end time to current time
  - If ride ID does not exist
    --> throw exception: "Ride not found"


====================================================
d. CONTROLLER PACKAGE
====================================================
File: RideController.java
Base Mapping: /api/rides

API ENDPOINTS:
--------------
Method | Endpoint                  | Description
-------|---------------------------|----------------------
POST   | /api/rides/book           | Book a ride
GET    | /api/rides/completed      | Get recent completed rides
POST   | /api/rides/end/{rideId}   | End a ride
GET    | /api/rides/users          | Get all users
GET    | /api/rides/drivers        | Get all drivers
GET    | /api/rides/ride-details   | Get all ride details


====================================================
IMPORTANT NOTES
====================================================
- The required endpoints are provided in RideController.java
  so that you can check them easily.
- FARE_PER_KM = 25.0 (Rs. 25 per KM) defined as a
  constant in RideService.java
- rideStatus values: "Ongoing" or "Completed" only
- endTime can be NULL when ride is ongoing
- driverId and userId are mandatory Foreign Keys


